.SH NAME
gyro-domain-register - Register domain


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgyro domain register [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Register domain

.PP
Register domain. Domain operations run against the registrar module of the domain. \fBSpends money / creates an invoice.\fP Money rules apply (AK-40): \fB"confirm": true\fR in the body, an \fBIdempotency-Key\fR header, account balance only (no stored card), daily limit per account; violations answer 422 with \fB[confirm_required]\fR, \fB[idempotency_key_required]\fR, \fB[balance_only]\fR or \fB[daily_limit]\fR in the message. Core WISECP client endpoint (Turkish reference: https://dev.wisecp.com/tr/alan-adi-edinme).

.PP
API: POST /domains/register (operationId coreRegisterDomain, scope Domains/RegisterDomain)


